  "attribution": "來源：《焦氏易林》，易學網《焦氏易林［四庫全書版］》（依據版本：《欽定四庫全書》子部術數類），https://www.eee-learning.com/book/giauii 。依來源要求標示出處及原網頁連結；本站僅整理林辭原文，並記錄收錄、標點及文字整理修改。",
  "entryCount": 64,
  "missingTargets": [],
  "entries": [
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 60,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 60,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 60,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 60,
      "hexagramName": "節",
      "poemText": "海為水王，聰聖且明。百流歸德，無有叛逆。常饒優足，不利攻玉。所求弗得。末二句疑衍）",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:961bf409e399ca1a0fbc311ee984afb4b64b88e5242d4bdf5be1f3e6c360acf0",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:5a54c6ffe8aef9c7115cdf465449ba9556adf28caaa5d59c0936b8dfaa6fbbaf"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 60,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 1,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 1,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 1,
      "hexagramName": "乾",
      "poemText": "虎豹怒咆，慎戒外憂。上下俱搔，士民無聊。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:9f6f5a110e82a2d81e3c4c8ebeb89fdd810ec11dfa2f7e812029f93141166fa4",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:46dc57b5bb397ecf06900dc62375443fd9b85dd7c79a6d25facc7fd7eac1e9cf"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 60,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 2,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 2,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 2,
      "hexagramName": "坤",
      "poemText": "探巢得雛，鳩鵲俱來，使我心憂。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:361008569eef4b09aa3251d4f68ca5381509db4502465c5819077f072657e9be",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:0d531434a4599f44f6850c66bec83c16f13c77daf9784711542d3a80b319e7cd"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 60,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 3,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 3,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 3,
      "hexagramName": "屯",
      "poemText": "日望一食，常恐不足，祿命寡薄。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:8a2da583164b445bdb56a0039f99e7307f5cbcbae0a76f95ea2ee991690ce52f",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:1960659364115b8775ede44fbaa631a3fdc846b21e0b170ac583014c64068b97"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 60,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 4,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 4,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 4,
      "hexagramName": "蒙",
      "poemText": "良馬疾走，千里一宿。離逃它鄉，誰能追復。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:f137419811f5ae1720357450efe404a21b278d67b89354ae549698e9e870b78d",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:8590bb8894e7d271f3c7ebd4cc13e1b11ba72484b78ae0826b635802cbf99e5d"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 60,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 5,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 5,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 5,
      "hexagramName": "需",
      "poemText": "鵲巢鳩城，上下不親。內外乖畔，子走失顧。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:1b07b4c097ddae2747524d59b05ede9a9a14e9231daf95e24ae95bcdcb0dfd5c",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:bf94075491d57a8d699c0c2b3e7c3eeb3fedb0557b6a5b89ca782257a20a21ac"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 60,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 6,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 6,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 6,
      "hexagramName": "訟",
      "poemText": "雲龍集會，征討西戎。招邊定眾，誰敢當鋒。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:92a5eeef295617e383dc011f3225bcd28e22991a5e97808421b1c39689864185",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:9e84f018a278de5d7c19a79c2663b5f43ebc2266fa51c6b386197252e493d08f"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 60,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 7,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 7,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 7,
      "hexagramName": "師",
      "poemText": "春多膏澤，夏潤優渥。稼穡成熟，畝獲百斛。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:2fe8b3c6b0e030cf927be2ed11e4fbdd0206865ae81fadc5e75357780fb320c5",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:c33e9f025dc5fbd141e27bf9bd07e65a733040700d8ac944e5807ee81e606152"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 60,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 8,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 8,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 8,
      "hexagramName": "比",
      "poemText": "僮妾獨宿，長女未室。利無所得。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:0d8fad68641d44221aa18785ed8dc883edb5609c5fed31f107e310bc88ae75b7",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:c2f4a649567b1f30fd2a1ad9bf8b89184a8ac0779c881ab462bbea5d682750b8"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 60,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 9,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 9,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 9,
      "hexagramName": "小畜",
      "poemText": "四野不安，東西為患。退身止足，無出邦域。乃得全完，賴其生福。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:f02c3995b373fe3428fd117dd22aa4fc89ea3a3cbf81e5de3ec0518442466b5e",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:90188e50d43ba0d01d1c8c67d66ed32cc2dbb285f2e157b06fd565f9bf93a285"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 60,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 10,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 10,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 10,
      "hexagramName": "履",
      "poemText": "長寧履福，安我百國。嘉賓上堂，與季同床。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:f826a921ad5b4af773444df445e656a4ebd1f7ceeb5efbc4b44d0606a83d30cc",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:acb97220255c827c846a79b2c5d21aec358b29f98ff7bfdcfaeb13c48ba7eed3"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 60,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 11,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 11,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 11,
      "hexagramName": "泰",
      "poemText": "騏驥綠耳，章明造父。伯夙奏獻，衰續厥緒。佐文成霸，為晉元輔。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:89bd9f45cd0bbeb7ffe541eae44bcf16670f8243f1633200eb130f30b146855d",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:ecd985df1d224e800310ae2e7deef2889e4425fd2ac264449a3f1a73cc0dd58f"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 60,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 12,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 12,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 12,
      "hexagramName": "否",
      "poemText": "張陳嘉謀，贊成漢都。主歡民喜，其樂休休。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:43959ad90abb5bab13b19f14d660a96c53905860e1e815f944707756848c4ed7",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:d1fdc8a8a3156b895ac6881387c4c58ebdc066a27f26aeba0bf672ce6035650e"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 60,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 13,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 13,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 13,
      "hexagramName": "同人",
      "poemText": "大面長頭，來解君憂。遺吾福善，與我嘉惠。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:a09caeed89664b8d7ef59dc1c2dfdc9d775abed58e7d5b3a71346178e1f18043",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:0424d46ea7e969daf4fd2b7e8818c3ad17afd06529fba160dc27665bbcd435ab"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 60,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 14,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 14,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 14,
      "hexagramName": "大有",
      "poemText": "畏昏不行，待旦昭明。燎獵受福，老賴其慶。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:ea76a5fe58e41ae7bb609ae88d98774dd16167c40771b01c0aad54aed46a2525",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:8df02fc82eb170b1f8f1003e774579a234686a29cada4e5d9d3e88ec4cc9f4c3"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 60,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 15,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 15,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 15,
      "hexagramName": "謙",
      "poemText": "伯去我東，首髮如蓬。長夜不寐，輾轉空床。內懷惆悵，憂摧肝腸。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:4ff8f8196347918e7eb926218d1159595cf88eea2fb353b859c6d506029c3ed1",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:202d4c82e347c5b68a196c36233983cdfcc8db11b3b4083be3d75532aafc11f8"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 60,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 16,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 16,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 16,
      "hexagramName": "豫",
      "poemText": "朽條腐索，不堪施用。安靜候時，以待親知。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:4d0b9b0614404ca8a509f1fbb51c2da07e1d24ea3b6d7bdaf58612ff3e072542",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:58577ab4190a89da416aae37a4958122de519e708c4c4290084cc144d5928652"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 60,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 17,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 17,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 17,
      "hexagramName": "隨",
      "poemText": "比目四翼，相倚為福。姜氏季女，與君合德。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:0bd2e52d2dd5d7e0e36aa2bf59c918436d4b0a3a776693e0f736948658548bc3",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:e60719eff7930c2d718a80028b5bc92557525240b928c460144ff394764dd274"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 60,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 18,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 18,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 18,
      "hexagramName": "蠱",
      "poemText": "履階升墀，高登崔嵬。福祿洋溢，依天之威。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:7b480e763375d91fe89f8158237a98412c312f23873c429253c8f440334ccc22",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:6e450629a528297955624bf9f0f3a1b17db206e02a99ef9cc27df5de6be24a9d"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 60,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 19,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 19,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 19,
      "hexagramName": "臨",
      "poemText": "奢淫吝嗇，神所不福。靈祗憑怒，鬼瞰其室。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:fb46a286a6f2fb2cd1ee8d8c960c918fe448cc0e8b22b9207566aebf29ab507a",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:0d739d5c6960afdde017d57bb14bab773233d6a9041015bb68d10ba44d5b8e9d"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 60,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 20,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 20,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 20,
      "hexagramName": "觀",
      "poemText": "大步上車，南到喜家。送我狐裘，與福載來。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:af11872a3c8c03abe286e4dedb3354a7c9a1230d1249931e7832984427faf5da",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:65a5869b95ed1624fef6e50956dc9e2192f35bbe8b37bda5fdd3a9ebccc6f474"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 60,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 21,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 21,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 21,
      "hexagramName": "噬嗑",
      "poemText": "東行西步，失次後合。乾侯野井，昭王失居，與彼作期，不覺至夜。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:f29004f5b732abe55c5a22d2d709b7545d33a31f90bd6b2b51094088d5820802",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:3bc6c21f4061b19e7c8948ac033eea407896ddd1675bac337dd93290dcc27927"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 60,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 22,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 22,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 22,
      "hexagramName": "賁",
      "poemText": "喜樂踴躍，來迎歡客。鵲巢百兩，以成嘉福，多獲利益。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:7080ee4c0047fc073068b7005dae7aafd774091ed52c1ca99092c1ec55ddf975",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:959d9ff336269491faa6d90aa50659996d6bdaada9cbf2eebc699f44b5dc2b0e"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 60,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 23,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 23,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 23,
      "hexagramName": "剝",
      "poemText": "非理所求，誰肯相與。往來不獲，徒勞道路。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:470310ad20dcadc907a5900d6d6cf8f62699febcda6b9bc6a5b7affeba780709",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:06c1eb65ee4c9c91b26e7deba3c71f5ed96a65d71296b2a3fc800abf6174339d"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 60,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 24,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 24,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 24,
      "hexagramName": "復",
      "poemText": "北虜匈奴，數侵邊境。左衽為長，國猶未慶。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:0ab722a5e8edffab6dcb3cdfc55f140aa2981f88a0489a39ffa9170f88fd17b5",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:eee9c063621933759685dd79284c64f2dfd68d6e632f97028d1f71c6cdd2516c"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 60,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 25,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 25,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 25,
      "hexagramName": "无妄",
      "poemText": "續事康域，鍼折不成。嬰兒短舌，說辭無名。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:cbd5b2ff5ad9535b21462f8020ab7452d2827139415f78a1228a62f7bb595977",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:2ba86768219fcd881d494dde3ea5c8bfe02a54567daa45e0e961400e29c7f0e8"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 60,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 26,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 26,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 26,
      "hexagramName": "大畜",
      "poemText": "景星明堂，麟遊鳳翔。仁施大行，頌聲作興。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:4c1ef4abf3b3ecfb08e5bb366a1258769d97920d4e73166d4c789937601d39ec",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:10ec2417d3c6f1ef9bed438c21331251435bcdca70959b337193817fd2210347"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 60,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 27,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 27,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 27,
      "hexagramName": "頤",
      "poemText": "文明之世，銷鋒鑄耜。以道順昌，百王不易。一作焚膏銷鋒，鎮壓危凶。招來文德，君安其國。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:caa0e9bd46eb58fb79dbc48780a9b8e9451eb4b8bc30ac172b28b6310f130394",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:4ed6fbbfc2ece0953f516a540606a6a95bb72648218ccf76ceb2c1c467bd1465"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 60,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 28,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 28,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 28,
      "hexagramName": "大過",
      "poemText": "鳥飛無羽，雞鬥折距。徒自長嗟，誰肯為侶。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:346a7e251c99f7b34d7e42ff61e6fc737d580b7ce645a290f94ed5293719f088",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:e57f5a902165471cd65ee1a843765675254faeb3c144737cc046c8b6f095ec86"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 60,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 29,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 29,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 29,
      "hexagramName": "坎",
      "poemText": "群隊虎狼，囓彼牛羊。道路不通，妨農害商。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:0d95adc8b21c5c925301e29662358a3c049617e4f18812839466381d37ee37df",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:646320c9f5df71397bf6c1e20ec0318648054998e7341ba1ce6cdea0905a2334"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 60,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 30,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 30,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 30,
      "hexagramName": "離",
      "poemText": "商伯沉醉，庶兄奔走。淫女蕩夫，仁德並孤。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:bd8738ced62e41fe95a2f117176196df4bfbea8156f253a033e0ed11b5d75489",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:9ab2568a886b463397ebfe1042e7c23cf248c130627882234b574dcfa57b6437"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 60,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 31,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 31,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 31,
      "hexagramName": "咸",
      "poemText": "三狸搏鼠，遮遏前後。當此之時，不能脫走。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:11cfc11a82a6dccc0dc8931d4d1101908cf8f065350198140e93f04da4aa365b",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:ab2e0cf8fa59bf3ee3e94f6c0989d7fc48ae968ac1ba7c88d9ff1512b0e36436"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 60,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 32,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 32,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 32,
      "hexagramName": "恒",
      "poemText": "陶叔孔圉，不處亂國。初雖未萌，後受福慶。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:cdb45dc6cc7750799514ca9f2a50eb6541855b9de31cc1f4c2f91080f60efa2f",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:0557a8cae82fe6308122cfdac2fc35acbe089aa8f7da5c37f739c2994effb795"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 60,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 33,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 33,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 33,
      "hexagramName": "遯",
      "poemText": "奮翅鼓翼，翱翔外國。逍遙北域，不入溫室。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:24fdad4be45a83f5a7bcd3b8e32a157f0459156f7cf2d129f57fc567c8861130",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:416236eb9d7793f653b7654c677de9926ee48ce9f36f8aba605268093933d15d"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 60,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 34,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 34,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 34,
      "hexagramName": "大壯",
      "poemText": "德音孔博，升在王室。八極蒙祐，受其福祿。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:9b66d336e50ba931558215333bc2390f068528c3850dc46b1ba5207dec364cd5",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:b0a11de9d23bc17d242aa9ed858645f8eb0d3cce37022b8cdce3d5819d971718"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 60,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 35,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 35,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 35,
      "hexagramName": "晉",
      "poemText": "當變立權，擿解患難。渙然冰釋，大國以安。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:474bb81e72f6400c0b1f1b19227356940cc8368a99487bd53da6bd6f623a44a7",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:a033b6065bc4dab857dc53b870dc69374d620b75a60ee3bc600e1cfb50654a67"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 60,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 36,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 36,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 36,
      "hexagramName": "明夷",
      "poemText": "羽動角甘，雨續草木，茂年歲熟。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:8baa001aed62d3a100ca733b6b91da05ee5b0793d68624b43d47b34a89517421",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:fd10aacb4b40348c9ae59f183c44ed411a87bcb5a257f79197b4ed8545bc95f6"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 60,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 37,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 37,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 37,
      "hexagramName": "家人",
      "poemText": "天所祐助，福來禍去，君王何憂。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:86f9461254f356ee45b46a70c12b91cf69d5b0cac988722b14fb01a4d6955290",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:7121bced05fbdc22b26d652e76234bbaa15b1b5d151bc3a75b6e9b53f4e48761"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 60,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 38,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 38,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 38,
      "hexagramName": "睽",
      "poemText": "方啄廣口，聖智仁厚。釋解倒懸，唐國大安。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:ea5bf713bbaa5b1deeed4db49f251a89e5d4b0b525859534796baf10c8beefa6",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:b45b738dd2af660221e1b541690732bed6b20957756eba2cb0a882e4db95cad9"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 60,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 39,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 39,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 39,
      "hexagramName": "蹇",
      "poemText": "葛藟蒙棘，華不得實。讒佞亂政，使恩壅塞。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:ae6f35faff88db9d227222b4d675aad37e4f42d4807e8d2305044605cee3d2e2",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:1d7c30d8feff922b2e8b27d8e83730436c3cd5649f57c5daa3a62f5187f3ff20"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 60,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 40,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 40,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 40,
      "hexagramName": "解",
      "poemText": "皇母多恩，字養孝孫。脫於襁褓，成就為君。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:2ea467a49459c0410fb549c55e7b9e40a07e7f8d7e1201c90a9fecaa25129be4",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:bee55a4c636688df14942a8a03a2571131f109978a8513901b2182e4222b2290"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 60,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 41,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 41,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 41,
      "hexagramName": "損",
      "poemText": "積水下濕，北陸苦寒。露宿多風，君子傷心。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:affbf613efa0ce5b96bb28cf7578befd8757e2733a1b0340842bacc3dc5317b3",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:38bd8c11f6088b0ac755b47dfb6a4f57fd708fc340a4e9c494a67111975b95a2"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 60,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 42,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 42,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 42,
      "hexagramName": "益",
      "poemText": "伯夷叔齊，貞廉之師。以德防患，憂禍不存。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:1bff7a3d756804218a0f08ab3cfb33c4d9b1d5ca0713aab3923c1f2d608782bc",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:78260c95cc8c3ad07b201a3259bd620299db12966d2d2aa4d9aab51fc9ea6943"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 60,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 43,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 43,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 43,
      "hexagramName": "夬",
      "poemText": "一雌二雄，子不得公。亂我族類，使吾心憒。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:73b76eefeeefe011894f787bff2571f8203dd29b11536c9d52f161128f8c72c2",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:e8e2642fac45ba802bcf7aa75a260dc9f37e1d304fa7fffe97925815eaf3060a"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 60,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 44,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 44,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 44,
      "hexagramName": "姤",
      "poemText": "主安多福，天祿所伏。居之寵昌，君子有光。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:2f6e100d29e01d8e9b8494d30981537f80d7963ec10a1f2596b872830e0fbc6b",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:0ff362fe9fbeb4f63720ae95fce1968429046f0e4e8f33af76966ee2f6e723cf"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 60,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 45,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 45,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 45,
      "hexagramName": "萃",
      "poemText": "千載槐根，身多斧瘢。樹維枯屈，枝葉不出。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:247549a248f7b541e8f3e1756030b4e47fa17bba5a3fd104529241855b239720",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:d446be82bf0f33305a2b7c1fd8434739195d3e77a1cc8418399edee2e5b9df2f"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 60,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 46,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 46,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 46,
      "hexagramName": "升",
      "poemText": "周師伐紂，勝殷牧野。甲子平旦，天下大喜。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:3c3c8cd23eaf1b4c5424d8c3cbeba518139ed46866e6fdc3b62be3c8fc74c475",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:ff56202077effa927a87fc420ba98dbbcd88b37b551020e62326b9a26c6ddf93"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 60,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 47,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 47,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 47,
      "hexagramName": "困",
      "poemText": "日走月步，趍不同舍。夫妻反目，主君失位。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:f404180c8dc1ea4ce0ec8d0b315e544a46aaa47821bca65eeb1a87e62369ad78",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:bfb27e7562e95e8de2bfe50206b5254980e6d51e856812959f3abfcb06df497b"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 60,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 48,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 48,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 48,
      "hexagramName": "井",
      "poemText": "宣勞就力，為王主國。安土成稷，天下蒙福。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:076cf9d82da35e1eb75d80b1155e349afa97e171f47e557c8affbbe33b5a55c1",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:d390fb2adffb6f1794772db9f9bc1171d80c0cdd6f91c16a720b2d9099fb3ac4"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 60,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 49,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 49,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 49,
      "hexagramName": "革",
      "poemText": "諷德誦功，美周盛隆。奭旦輔成，光濟沖人。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:0e3a60c08c24d9639ceab9c8232be3cd12eca4771b72e116ece99c2e620395e8",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:ff9bd439a5751d669da9950d08c999c39a6edebf8880960bc868230abd02f03b"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 60,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 50,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 50,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 50,
      "hexagramName": "鼎",
      "poemText": "三夜不寢，憂來益甚。戒以危懼，棄其安居。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:8f7d7c72f4704fd223c7be93727cea4b6a816107285a934361f849520c5bce9b",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:8956bca13ec6635b576ee1c3d3795cd396b57cbe2b948bbdda1b1831d9c36859"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 60,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 51,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 51,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 51,
      "hexagramName": "震",
      "poemText": "思願所之，乃今逢時。洗濯故憂，并其所來。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:409560737c1c4f5ad44c8094e723184b6c3f6a4fa43552b718996192bdb228cd",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:27e46ace7e3c023f49be0d03c2f1a854472d9c2c3eee5fe20a740fdba6da14ef"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 60,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 52,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 52,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 52,
      "hexagramName": "艮",
      "poemText": "噂噂懾懾，夜行晝伏。謀議我資，來攻吾室。空盡己財，幾無所食。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:d647e3697501d383611d898a13fa1d6d2bb6bb5a4804a20c354075032fe2ba5b",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:cc6700126e73981a4cca5301da45ede625b017b0e880839be18e4639ea31601a"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 60,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 53,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 53,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 53,
      "hexagramName": "漸",
      "poemText": "騂牛亡子，鳴於大野。申後陰徵，還歸其母。說我除悔。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:986edeaa3e862aa4eaa61b83679954d074ae3a2df866a239a21aec7242e03b0c",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:5b84a5a86d3f31392a906a03484d07425aef6c4889731a00afc5380626a26938"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 60,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 54,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 54,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 54,
      "hexagramName": "歸妹",
      "poemText": "王良善御，伯樂知馬。周旋步驟，行中規矩。止息有節，延命壽考。遯之豫）",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:58cfb1035b69ffdf0fe793cb79db914413d689c272f95799f61b849f627d6c53",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:788a24ed334e5442be34651fca99d1955c18f72ce66ec3391082fd141e8bf8d8"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 60,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 55,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 55,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 55,
      "hexagramName": "豐",
      "poemText": "釋然遠咎，避患革害。田獲三狐，以貝為寶。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:81b38e1762f97d2060344118df7746dcd8e2966d3f0a3f66d71714cb9c6e762a",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:b96fba11f611721cf08837ea5cc768645ea698ef92dd5a9554a2e8b86af4bb44"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 60,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 56,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 56,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 56,
      "hexagramName": "旅",
      "poemText": "仁獸所處，國無凶咎。市賈十倍，復歸惠里。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:76a04846718ab185777aa4139984f32aca6ce449b69bba497c1bd0c04f5ac161",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:a51fbce0245ac41403a7b6a3b14ea3d033b8e9b2c269204e970e883051ec486b"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 60,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 57,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 57,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 57,
      "hexagramName": "巽",
      "poemText": "六目俱視，各欲有志。一言不同，乖戾生訟。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:02c949e0fe393e07e8ff008687621649a9ae7f2896e008bc195770dc3ba264ac",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:a96a7434aee31f1bf1fab937508c5e6a9b50897cb3cb47073c3835445259b452"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 60,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 58,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 58,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 58,
      "hexagramName": "兌",
      "poemText": "傅說休明，驂御四龍。周徑萬里，無有危凶。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:c7ed08f442da16a50096082995ab189a2efd9e3486fdecb78c7b52161f54205a",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:c8084d904562d3fc88228edc6561d77fad9e15d16768f3bf3cc43d11c5cdb8ac"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 60,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 59,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 59,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 59,
      "hexagramName": "渙",
      "poemText": "伯仲叔季，日暮寢寐。醉醒失明，喪其貝囊。臥拜道旁。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:b8d62786f305268d4999afd8a0724b0d328d6771fe0a9544ec3b863fc3229017",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:e3b3e1ea2ef37d662deb6d3fe0a1a8cae5f58ada804f0705bf2fba4ecde92318"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 60,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 61,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 61,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 61,
      "hexagramName": "中孚",
      "poemText": "江有寶珠，海多大魚。亟行疾至，可以得財。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:36451699cd0f9023d4627617e0f7e7de056851f4cd6ca1887d0eecdca8dd1118",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:a3ffd05842da0941addde2fb52c85a34e853dc7f384a4d68412e230b45ca1179"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 60,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 62,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 62,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 62,
      "hexagramName": "小過",
      "poemText": "遠視千里，不見所視。離婁之明，無益於耳。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:80d402c238eff4cf7f538ac3a66a263b64e8ca61462409dd5c76d552ee9f1cb4",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:b2f4cf91dde759ae90a7448329d685c5806e30a77dbbe0441b268b2f34a73ad5"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 60,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 63,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 63,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 63,
      "hexagramName": "既濟",
      "poemText": "弱足刖跟，不利出門。市賈無贏，折亡為患。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:dd76ce311760c35f3ebd5e66745e78ff10d45958c033d5c612309cf03f6ee7d6",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:31c9de314bbceae1da53aff9b294dd1685822b71f1029deaa33da672a94e4ebc"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 60,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 64,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 64,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 64,
      "hexagramName": "未濟",
      "poemText": "利盡得媒，時不我來。鳴雌深步，寡宿獨居。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:12cdad10e1e0c5e2e5272e223ef973f23b3e92e840418a06e25d564982fc45cc",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:079696aa7331dd7b3915acc331f1974e05f2c56fa9259974ab63884f7ef4ed8f"
    }
  ]
}
